EmailTemplate.textOnly:
Hi,

Please note the following New Account has been created. 

IMPORTANT: Please verify whether Customer Code exists. If it already exists, please do not create a new account, instead please update the account details as per below.

Customer code (Loc#): {!Account.Freight_Location__c}

Agent/Customer Name: {!Account.Name}

Global Customer Code (FCI): {!Account.Freight_Corporate_Identifier__c}

Address: {!Account.BillingAddress}

ABN: {!Account.ABN_Tax_Reference__c}

Account number (Cust#): {!Account.Freight_eQ_Reference__c}

Financial Address number (Ref#): {!Account.Freight_Reference__c}

Customer Type: Domestic

Billing Calendar: {!Account.Freight_Billing_Calendar__c}

Billing Period: 30 days

Currency: AUD

Contact Details: {!Contact.Name}

Phone: {!Contact.Phone}

Fax: {!Contact.Fax}

Email: {!Contact.Email}

Thanks,

{!Account.OwnerFullName}

{!Account.OwnerEmail}
